Package: sdg4.indicator.pipeline
Type: Project
Title: sdg4-indicator-pipeline
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Meltem Odabaş
Maintainer: Meltem Odabaş <me@meltemodabas.net>
Encoding: UTF-8
Description: Declares this project's R package dependencies. renv is
    configured with snapshot type "explicit", so renv.lock records exactly
    what is declared here rather than whatever renv can infer from library()
    calls in the code. Add packages under an Imports: field below, one per
    line and comma-separated, then re-run scripts/00-setup.R. For example:
    Imports:
        tidyverse,
        here,
        yaml
Depends:
    R (>= 4.6)
Imports:
    readr,
    dplyr,
    tidyr,
    yaml,
    openxlsx2,
    mschart,
    officer
